  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `application_builder_helpers` from `4.1.136` to `4.1.137`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/application_builder_helpers/4.1.136...application_builder_helpers/4.1.137)\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(cli): typed List factory via CreateTypedList (root cause: MakeGenericType IL3050 path) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/431\n* Bump xunit.runner.visualstudio from 3.1.5 to 4.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/361\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/build.20260914103100.469fc1e...build.20260915114545.81b0995",
